  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "这井盖真棒。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94E9576D6771F68D230020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "停下！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "505C4E0BFF01FF0100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没错！请停下脚步，\n低头看看你的脚边！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA19519FF018BF7505C4E0B811A6B65FF0C000A4F4E5934770B770B4F607684811A8FB9FF0100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷市有印着宝可梦的\n设计图案的井盖。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F75E026709537077405B9D53EF68A67684000A8BBE8BA156FE684876844E9576D6300200100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是所谓的宝可梦井盖。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F5C31662F62408C1376845B9D53EF68A64E9576D6300200100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那其中的一个就是它！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A351764E2D76844E004E2A5C31662F5B83FF0100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "翡绿区使用的是\n坐骑山羊的井盖！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7FE17EFF533A4F7F75287684662F000A57509A915C717F8A76844E9576D6FF0100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么，\n我要来考考你。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E48FF0C000A621189816765800380034F60300200100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "榴红区的井盖图案上\n设计的宝可梦是什么呢？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n请把你觉得“就是它！”的\n那种宝可梦给我看看吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "69B47EA2533A76844E9576D656FE68484E0A000A8BBE8BA176845B9D53EF68A6662F4EC04E485462FF1F00100001BE01000A8BF7628A4F6089C95F97201C5C31662F5B83FF01201D7684000A90A379CD5B9D53EF68A67ED96211770B770B5427300200100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你能给我看看\n榴红区的井盖图案上<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n设计的那种宝可梦吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6080FD7ED96211770B770B000A69B47EA2533A76844E9576D656FE68484E0A00100001BE00000A8BBE8BA1768490A379CD5B9D53EF68A65417FF1F00100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这就给你看！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD95C317ED94F60770BFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果你知道答案是什么，\n并且带着那只宝可梦，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就请再来和我搭话吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C4F6077E590537B546848662F4EC04E48FF0C000A5E764E145E26774090A353EA5B9D53EF68A6FF0C00100001BE00000A5C318BF7518D6765548C6211642D8BDD5427300200100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请告诉我井盖的图案上\n设计的是哪种宝可梦吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF7544A8BC962114E9576D6768456FE68484E0A000A8BBE8BA17684662F54EA79CD5B9D53EF68A65427300200100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果你想到了哪只宝可梦是正确答案，\n就来给我看看吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C4F6060F352304E8654EA53EA5B9D53EF68A6662F6B63786E7B546848FF0C000A5C3167657ED96211770B770B5427FF0100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "很遗憾，回答错误……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F88905761BEFF0C56DE7B5495198BEF2026202600100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雄性的火炎狮……\n很接近正确答案了，但还是不对～！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96C460277684706B708E72EE20262026000A5F8863A58FD16B63786E7B5468484E86FF0C4F468FD8662F4E0D5BF9FF5EFF0100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雌性的火炎狮……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96CC60277684706B708E72EE2026202600100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "锵锵锵磅～♪<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "95359535953578C5FF5E266A00100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "回答正确～！答得漂亮！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56DE7B546B63786EFF5EFF017B545F976F024EAEFF01FF0100100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "宝可梦井盖分别有着各自的主题，\n而榴红区的主题是“热情”，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n是不是和雌性的火炎狮完美契合呀？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B9D53EF68A64E9576D65206522B67097740540481EA76844E3B9898FF0C000A800C69B47EA2533A76844E3B9898662F201C70ED60C5201DFF0C00100001BE00000A662F4E0D662F548C96CC60277684706B708E72EE5B8C7F8E595154085440FF1F00100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "顺带一提，至于其他区的主题，\n据说翡绿区是“友爱”，浦蓝区是“谦逊”，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n然后蓉粉区是“高雅”，\n而琼黄区则是“活泼”。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "987A5E264E0063D0FF0C81F34E8E51764ED6533A76844E3B9898FF0C000A636E8BF47FE17EFF533A662F201C53CB7231201DFF0C6D6684DD533A662F201C8C26900A201DFF0C00100001BE01000A7136540E84C97C89533A662F201C9AD896C5201DFF0C000A800C743C9EC4533A5219662F201C6D3B6CFC201D300200100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "偶尔试着在走路时\n留意一下井盖也蛮不错的。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n当然，也别忘了看好前方的路。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "50765C148BD5774057288D708DEF65F6000A7559610F4E004E0B4E9576D64E5F86EE4E0D95197684300200100001BE00000A5F537136FF0C4E5F522B5FD84E86770B597D524D65B976848DEF300200100002011401B10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
