      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "偶尔试着在走路时\n留意一下井盖也蛮不错的。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n当然，也别忘了看好前方的路。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƱ",
